# Sprint Lease Anatomy (no babysitting)

## Convergent target (this lease)

**Close Node0** (honest, no false-GREEN) + **Dema active** (local face usable: `node bin/dema`, doctor/first-run, outsider loop).

Not in this lease: federation · Node1 · mint/wallet · RSI-live claims · silent Downloads ingest.

Do **not** claim `NODE0_CLOSED` or `DEMA_ACTIVE_LOCAL=true` until disk/gates prove it. Target ≠ done.

## Standing grant (this rule IS the lease)

On every Dema-clean session, without waiting for SPARC paste walls:

1. **Rebind** — `git status -sb`, HEAD vs `origin/main`, dirty paths. Disk beats transcript.
2. **One SNR slice** — toward the convergent target; highest-value, lowest-noise, reversible, testable. Reject the rest in one line.
3. **Do it** — implement + focused tests. Do not ask for GO on ordinary in-scope edits.
4. **Prove** — narrowest test; report exit codes.
5. **Close the chain** — ship · note OUTWARD blockers · one next slice · **finish follow-through in the same turn** (restore ruleset after bypass-merge, reply+resolve review threads you fixed, update this board). Do not ping the operator for a second typed GO on cleanup you already opened.

## Auto-GO (inside lease)

- Edit / add tests / run focused tests / update matching docs for the slice
- Commit when user said commit, or “sprint” / “keep going” / “carry me” / “carry the lease” for that slice’s green proof
- Chain post-act cleanup that the same GO implied (e.g. restore ruleset after admin-bypass merge; push-then-merge when both were in the plan)
- Leave unrelated dirty trees untouched

## Still halt (fresh typed GO only)

Push · merge · force · delete branches · keys/DID · mint · deploy · secrets · foreign-repo edits · Drive bulk move · live model/daemon start · widening `authority_delta` beyond this lease’s convergent target

## Forbidden noise

- Re-paste SPARC / Peak / Singularity / HHMM / full PDF dumps as the work itself
- Multi-agent theater without a bounded slice
- Claiming Node0-closed / RSI-live / federation / Dema-active without proof
- Full `npm test` when focused suite answers; note OUTWARD blockers honestly (billing lock, COVERAGE-COUNTS)
- Halting mid-chain for “say X next” when X was already the closeout of the authorized act

